JBIG2 decoder (PDFium and Mozilla PDF.js bindings)
-------------------------------------------------
Vendored from Mozilla PDF.js v6.4.299, external/jbig2/jbig2.wasm:
https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js/tree/v6.4.299/external/jbig2
Bindings source: https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js.jbig2
PDFium revision: bb1f9f71e7b15afdd5937adf8cfe5807522b882f

HEPR changes: direct local WASM adapter; a private countdown global and
stack-neutral function/loop instrumentation invoke batched work-budget and
cancellation checks; declared memory maximum lowered to 512 MiB, with a
further per-operation cap. Pixel-decoding instructions retain their original
order and operand/control-flow behavior. Original import/export indices are
preserved. The unmodified upstream binary, manifest and reproducible
instrumentation script are retained in the source checkout.
